@startuml
title Proposed Assessment-to-Review Sequence — Draft
autonumber
actor Learner
actor HR
participant "Web Application" as Web
database "Application DB" as DB
participant "RubroRAG Service" as AI

Learner -> Web : Open assigned assessment
Web -> DB : Check assignment and attempt policy
DB --> Web : Permitted assessment snapshot
Web --> Learner : Instructions and current attempt state
Learner -> Web : Submit answers
Web -> Web : Validate deadline and lifecycle state
Web -> DB : Persist submission atomically
DB --> Web : Submission ID and status
Web --> Learner : Submission confirmation

opt Approved AI workflow requested
  Web -> AI : Send validated request and version metadata
  AI --> Web : Structured proposal / feedback / errors
  Web -> DB : Store AI output separately from final HR score
end

HR -> Web : Review submission and available AI evidence
Web -> DB : Load submission and review state
DB --> Web : Submission + versioned output
Web --> HR : Review workspace
HR -> Web : Confirm/correct final result
Web -> DB : Persist HR-owned final score and approval
HR -> Web : Release result
Web -> DB : Record release state and audit event
Learner -> Web : View results
Web -> DB : Check learner ownership and release state
DB --> Web : Only permitted released result
Web --> Learner : Released outcome and feedback

note over Web,DB
DRAFT. Verify the exact states, transaction boundaries,
and whether AI scoring is in the approved product scope.
end note
@enduml
